data: {"type": "search_results", "agent": "DeepScout", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T22:34:17.903977", "content": {"results": [{"id": "sr_40fcf1", "title": "军用无人机行业现状与发展空间调研报告2024年_微型无人机_分析_市场", "source": "搜狐", "url": "https://www.sohu.com/a/804864046_121956947", "snippet": "据贝哲斯咨询发布的军用无人机市场调研报告,全球军用无人机市场规模2023年达到765.56亿元(人民币)。报告结合全球经济政策形势和市场动态,对全球军用无人机市场做出合理预测,预计至2029年全球军用无人机市场规模将会达到1284.48亿元,以9.06%的复合年增长率增长。 军用无人机市场按类型可进一步细分为即将完成交易(ARF), 微型无人机, 微型无人机(MAV), 捆绑交易(BNF),", "date": "2024-08-30T07:16:00+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_678e16", "title": "无人机系统按用途分类示意-行业数据-三个皮匠报告", "source": "三个皮匠报告", "url": "https://www.sgpjbg.com/hyshuju/df6c4882bfc76c1f09a7bdf32f87af7c.html", "snippet": "全球军用无人机市场规模可观。根据蒂尔集团的预测,以无人机年产值(含采购)计算的全球军用无人机市场规模自 2019-2028 年将持续增长,预计 2028 年全球军用无人机市场规模将达到 147.98 亿美元,年复合增长率约为 5.36%。目前世界范围内具有无人机完整产业链的国家仅有以色列、美国、中国。我国无人机系统发展起步晚于美国、以色列、英国等军事科技强国。近十几年来,我国无人机系统的发展呈厚积薄发趋势。各航空企事业单位凭借其技术实力和产业竞争优势,推动了产品技术和产业体系向高端领域迈进,我国军用无人机系统在核心技术和主要产品方面紧跟国际先进水平,发展势头迅猛,正在迈入创新性的跨越式发展新阶段。", "date": "2024-09-22T10:23:48+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_b17bb5", "title": "2024 年至 2028 年，军用无人机市场规模将增长 85 亿美元，军用无人机的最新发展推动了市场发展", "source": "航空产业网", "url": "https://m.chinaerospace.com/article/show/4ca73f8a3da71f984ca2b12b558f9621", "snippet": "据 Technavio 称,全球军用无人机市场规模预计将在 2024 年至 2028 年间增长 85 亿美元 。预计在预测期内,该市场的复合年增长率将达到 12.21%。军用无人机的最新发展正在推动市场增长,其中远程间谍作战无人机的发展趋势尤为明显。然而,反无人机技术的快速发展带来了挑战。主要市场参与者包括 AeroVironment Inc.、Airbus SE、Anduril Industries Inc.、Animal Dynamics Ltd.、Asteria Aerospace Ltd.、BAE Systems Plc、EDGE Group PJSC、Elbit Systems Ltd.、General Atomics、Israel Aerospace Industries Ltd.、Leonardo Spa、Lockheed Martin Corp.、Northrop Grumman Corp.、Rafael Advanced Defense Systems Ltd.、RTX Corp.、Red Cat Holdings Inc.、Saab AB、Shield AI、Teledyne Technologies Inc.、Textron Inc.、Thales Group 和波音公司。\n军用无人机市场范围\n报告范围 细节\n基准年 2023\n历史时期 2018 - 2022\n预测期 2024-2028\n增长动力和复合年增长率 复合年增长率达 12.21%\n2024-2028 年市场增长 85.078亿美元\n市场结构 支离破碎\n2022-2023 年同比增长 (%) 10.66\n区域分析 北美、亚太地区、欧洲、中东和非洲以及南美\n履行市场贡献 亚太地区占35%\n主要国家 美国、中国、英国、印度和土耳其\n重点公司简介 AeroVironment Inc.、Airbus", "date": "2024-06-10T08:00:00+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_b2a52e", "title": "「行业前瞻」2024-2029年全球及中国军用无人机行业发展分析未来战争先进水平_网易订阅", "source": "网易", "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/JJN7U1JJ051480KF.html", "snippet": "2024年全球军用无人机行业市场规模达227亿美元无人机(unmanned aerialvehicle,简称UAV),是利用无线电遥控设备和自备的程序控制装置操纵的不载人飞机。2023年全球军用无人机产业市场规模达227亿美元。初步估算,2024年全球军用无人机产业市场规模将达到227亿美元,预计未来五年行业市场规模复合增速将达到15.35%美国军用无人机位居全球前列根据专做无人机市场调研的机构Drone IndustryInsights发布的无人机市场环境统计数据显示,全球已经有包括美国、以色列、加拿大、德国、英国、法国、俄罗斯等在内的多个国家研发无人机,超过80个国家装备无人机。2019年全球无人机市场规模约259亿美元,其中军用无人机市场规模达169亿美元,接近民用无人机市场规模的两倍。", "date": "2024-12-18T18:03:21+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_cf5e47", "title": "【无人机】行业市场规模:2024年全球无人机行业市场规模达889亿美元 民用无人机市场占比达76%无人机_新浪财经_新浪网", "source": "新浪财经", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/2024-12-04/doc-incyhpwv0754636.shtml", "snippet": "2023年全球无人机产业市场规模达821亿美元,同比增长15.96%。初步估算,2024年全球无人机产业市场规模将达到889亿美元。 细分市场 无人机根据用途主要可以分为军用无人机和民用无人机。从细分市场结构来看,2023年全球无人机市场主要以民用无人机为主,占比达76.0%。民用无人机应用领域包括农林植保、能源电力、地理观测、行政服务、消防用途等。 产业竞争", "date": "2024-12-04T14:30:00+08:00"}], "isIncremental": true, "searchType": "信源追溯", "depth": 2}}

data: {"type": "search_results", "agent": "DeepScout", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T22:34:18.176108", "content": {"results": [{"id": "sr_2e2f71", "title": "2020年1-6月中国无人机(88022000)出口贸易情况统计(下载)_IIM信息", "source": "www.iim.net.cn", "url": "https://www.iim.net.cn/2244/view-698-1.html", "snippet": "2020年1-6月中国无人机(88022000)出口贸易情况统计(下载)\n时间:2020-09-13\n00:27:43\n来源:https://www.iim.net.cn/\n日期\nHS\nCODE\n产品描述\n原产国\n目的国\n量\n金额\n“2020年1-6月中国无人机(88022000)出口贸易情况统计(下载)”,需要\n标准版VIP_无人机\n才能访问,\n请\n[联系客服]\n或\n[登录系统]。", "date": "2020-09-13T00:27:43+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_a996f8", "title": "我国无人机主要出口国_行行查_行业研究数据库", "source": "行行查", "url": "https://www.hanghangcha.com/cms/detail/136037.html", "snippet": "查一下 行业研究数据库 行业图谱研究 行业深度新闻 创业投资数据库 知名创投机构 重点项目动态 证券研究数据库 中国宏观数据 区域上市企业 无人机 登录网站查看更多数据 行业相关推荐 行业图谱 信息科技 传统产业 地产金融 先进制造 节能环保 传媒娱乐 生命健康", "date": "2020-11-10T18:03:04+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_9770f8", "title": "2008-2018年中国无人机出口市场份额_行行查_行业研究数据库", "source": "行行查", "url": "https://www.hanghangcha.com/cms/detail/216089.html", "snippet": "查一下 行业研究数据库 行业图谱研究 行业深度新闻 创业投资数据库 知名创投机构 重点项目动态 证券研究数据库 中国宏观数据 区域上市企业 无人机 登录网站查看更多数据 行业相关推荐 传统产业 地产金融 先进制造 节能环保 传媒娱乐 生命健康", "date": "2021-03-30T13:49:38+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_ced4c9", "title": "军用无人机(UAS/UAV):2013-2022年全球估计产量-宏观经济数据分析-权威行业数据平台-艾媒数据中心", "source": "艾媒数据中心", "url": "https://data.iimedia.cn/data-classification/detail/44482743.html", "snippet": "短信登录 一周内保持登录 创建/忘记密码? 企业登录 搜索热词: 搜索热词 消息通知 全部标记已读 暂无新消息 查看全部 智库VIP 未开通 开通会员,免费浏览海量数据 立即开通 续费 我的收藏 我的发票 个人中心 金鹰计划 帮助中心 门店数据 退出登录 点击按相关度搜索 展示停更数据 会员数据 根据CC准则,此许可证向用户授予以下权利:署名来源;禁止修改;允许商业转载。Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0国际公共许可证更多信息 在线咨询 刷新图表 标题设置 字体大小 数值显示 刻度设置 图片属性 图表 列表 媒体图表 下载 PNG XLS PPT 显示数值 联合logo 图表展示: 全部时间 全部时间 最近一周 最近一月 最近半年 最近一年 最近三年 最近五年 图表展示: 图表展示: 日期选择 (拖动上方滑块改变图表横轴范围) 去 投融数据库 看详细数据 >> 多年同列只支持月频或季频指标 时间 数据(亿元) 每页20条共0条 最近浏览数据 更新频度 单位 来源 最新数据 更新时间 注释说明 轴线设置 线形设置 颜色设置 设置 欢迎登陆,查看深度数据详情", "date": "2022-01-01T00:00:00+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_e0a3c1", "title": "2025军用无人机发展趋势、我国出口现状及相关企业分析报告 - 远瞻慧库", "source": "www.baogaobox.com", "url": "https://www.baogaobox.com/reports/250929000078326.html", "snippet": "版权声明:报告来自互联网,仅供投资者学习和参考,在发布信息时,我们将尽最大努力标明出处,但因互联网的去中心、海量信息的特殊结构,可能有时会存在未指明作者的失误,我们诚挚的希望您能指出我们的工作失误,如果您(单位或个人)认为本站的内容有侵权嫌疑,烦请通知我们(kefu@baogaobox.com),我们将在第一时间处理核实,同时如果您的报告不愿在本站展示,请联系我们删除或更改,谢谢。本站仅提供用户检索、查询报告服务,以便快速找到报告的来源、作者等信息,不提供下载服务。如需下载,请前往社群。\n文章名称:《2025军用无人机发展趋势、我国出口现状及相关企业分析报告》\n文章链接:https://www.baogaobox.com/reports/250929000078326.html", "date": "2025-09-27T00:00:00+08:00"}], "isIncremental": true, "searchType": "信源追溯", "depth": 2}}

data: {"type": "search_results", "agent": "DeepScout", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T22:34:22.732738", "content": {"results": [{"id": "sr_67f602", "title": "China's auto exports up 23 percent in 2024 - China.org.cn", "source": "China Daily", "url": "http://www.china.org.cn/business/2025-02/11/content_117707565.htm", "snippet": "China's automobile exports maintained growth momentum in 2024, data from the China Passenger Car Association (CPCA) showed on Tuesday. China shipped a total of 6.41 million vehicles overseas last year, surging by 23 percent year on year, according to the CPCA. In December 2024, the auto exports soared by 25 percent year on year to hit 570,000 units, the association said. Russia, Mexico, and the United Arab Emirates (UAE) were the leading countries as China's vehicle export destinations, while the top five countries driving China's vehicle export growth were Russia, the UAE, Brazil, Belgium and Saudi Arabia.", "date": "2025-02-11T20:58:58+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_48f681", "title": "China's auto exports up 23 percent in 2024 - BELT AND ROAD PORTAL", "source": "eng.yidaiyilu.gov.cn", "url": "https://eng.yidaiyilu.gov.cn/p/0GC7H1A2.html", "snippet": "BEIJING,\nFeb.\n12\n(Xinhua)\n--\nChina's\nautomobile\nexports\nmaintained\ngrowth\nmomentum\nin\n2024,\ndata\nfrom\nthe\nChina\nPassenger\nCar\nAssociation\n(CPCA)\nshowed\non\nTuesday.\nChina\nshipped\na\ntotal\nof\n6.41\nmillion\nvehicles\noverseas\nlast\nyear,\nsurging\nby\n23\npercent\nyear\non\nyear,\naccording\nto\nthe\nCPCA.\nIn\nDecember\n2024,\nthe\nauto\nexports\nsoared\nby\n25\npercent\nyear\non\nyear\nto\nhit\n570,000\nunits,\nthe\nassociation\nsaid.\nRussia,\nMexico,\nand\nthe\nUnited\nArab\nEmirates\n(UAE)\nwere\nthe\nleading\ncountries\nas\nChina's\nvehicle\nexport\ndestinations,\nwhile\nthe\ntop\nfive\ncountries\ndriving\nChina's\nvehicle\nexport\ngrowth\nwere\nRussia,\nthe\nUAE,\nBrazil,\nBelgium\nand\nSaudi\nArabia.", "date": "2025-02-12T00:00:00+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_4bfbda", "title": "China's auto exports up 23% in 2024 - SHINE News", "source": "www.shanghaidaily.com", "url": "http://www.shanghaidaily.com/biz/auto/2502117271/", "snippet": "China's automobile exports maintained growth momentum in 2024, data from the China Passenger Car Association showed on Tuesday. China shipped a total of 6.41 million vehicles overseas last year,", "date": "2025-02-11T19:17:20+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_95c0b5", "title": "China's auto exports up 23% in 2024 - City News Service", "source": "www.citynewsservice.cn", "url": "https://www.citynewsservice.cn/articles/china-biz-buzz/auto/chinas-auto-exports-up-23-in-2024-4m3rqxym", "snippet": "China's\nautomobile\nexports\nmaintained\ngrowth\nmomentum\nin\n2024,\ndata\nfrom\nthe\nChina\nPassenger\nCar\nAssociation\nshowed\non\nTuesday.\nChina\nshipped\na\ntotal\nof\n6.41\nmillion\nvehicles\noverseas\nlast\nyear,\nsurging\nby\n23\npercent\nyear\non\nyear,\naccording\nto\nthe\nCPCA.\nIn\nDecember\n2024,\nthe\nauto\nexports\nsoared\nby\n25\npercent\nyear\non\nyear\nto\nhit\n570,000\nunits,\nthe\nassociation\nsaid.\nRussia,\nMexico,\nand\nthe\nUnited\nArab\nEmirates\nwere\nthe\nleading\ncountries\nas\nChina's\nvehicle\nexport\ndestinations,\nwhile\nthe\ntop\nfive\ncountries\ndriving\nChina's\nvehicle\nexport\ngrowth\nwere\nRussia,\nthe\nUAE,\nBrazil,\nBelgium\nand\nSaudi\nArabia.", "date": "2025-02-11T00:00:00+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_d416bb", "title": "China's auto exports up 23% in 2024 - Chinadaily.com.cn", "source": "China Daily", "url": "http://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202502/11/WS67ab2a82a310a2ab06eab969.html", "snippet": "Share Share - WeChat Vehicles are lined up for export in the Haitong International Automotive Terminal in Taicang Port, Jiangsu province. JI HAIXIN/FOR CHINA DAILY BEIJING -- China's automobile exports maintained growth momentum in 2024, data from the China Passenger Car Association (CPCA) showed on Tuesday. China shipped a total of 6.41 million vehicles overseas last year, surging by 23 percent year-on-year, according to the CPCA. In December 2024, the auto exports soared by 25 percent year-on-year to hit 570,000 units, the association said. Russia, Mexico, and the United Arab Emirates (UAE) were the leading countries as China's vehicle export destinations, while the top five countries driving China's vehicle export growth were Russia, the UAE, Brazil, Belgium and Saudi Arabia. China unve", "date": "2025-02-11T18:46:00+08:00"}], "isIncremental": true, "searchType": "信源追溯", "depth": 2}}

